      ":question/problem": "A curve is defined by the parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+8,\\,y=4\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+4,\\,-3\\pi \\le t<-\\pi .\n$$\n\nDetermine the values of $t$ at which the tangent to the curve is vertical.",
