    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "A curve is defined by the parametric equations \n\n$$\nx=2(t+5)^{3},\\,y=10t,\\,-\\infty <t<\\infty .\n$$\n\nDetermine the value of $t$ at which the tangent to the curve is vertical.",
